# Keep the built harness bundle at LF everywhere. The build (esbuild) emits LF;
# without this, a Windows checkout converts dist to CRLF and then every build
# shows dist/cli.js as "modified" (LF -> CRLF) with zero real content change,
# which made release builds look stale and added noise to every diff. Forcing
# eol=lf on the committed artifacts keeps the working tree matching the build.
plugins/mixshift-ai/harness/dist/* text eol=lf
